for almost a year jonathan tebe a u.s  navy nuclear engineer and his wife diana  a high school humanities teacher at a  prestigious private annapolis high  school sold top secret information  concerning the design of the u.s navy's  virginia-class nuclear-powered warships  in exchange for cryptocurrency to a  person they thought was representing a  foreign power in fact that person was an  undercover fbi agent  the couple lived in a quiet neighborhood  in annapolis and drove a mini cooper  they didn't talk to anybody even on the  block they moved here in 2014 and been  up and down this block so many times and  we would see them and  never even say hi don't even like catch  your eye the navy nuclear engineer had a  high level security clearance and worked  for the top secret naval reactors  program near the pentagon in april 2020  he sent the first package of classified  documents to a foreign government which  passed the information back to a u.s  defense attache suggesting the country  may have been an ally i apologize for  this poor translation into your language  please forward this letter to your  military intelligence agency i believe  this information will be of great value  to your nation this is not a hoax  the criminal complaint says tebay  visited washington d.c over memorial day  posing as a tourist and asked his  handlers to fly a flag signal from the  roof of their embassy to indicate he was  talking to the right people and not the  u.s government at the first dead drop in  west virginia quote the fbi recovered a  blue 16 gigabyte sandisk sd card left by  jonathan tebe at the dead drop location  the sd card was wrapped in plastic and  placed between two slices of bread on a  half of a peanut butter sandwich the  half sandwich was housed inside of a  plastic bag  tebe and his wife were arrested on  saturday in west virginia where they  will be in court tomorrow they have two  children the couple could face life in  prison hey sean hannity here hey click 